          "content": "### Only real incidents open a war room\n1. **Rules first**: sev1 always opens; rules people approved can drop known noise; **Staging alerts** asks.\n2. **AI triage** reads the alert and its threat intel. Its verdict never drops an alert: *noise* and *unsure* ask on-call.\n3. Every decision is a row in **Triage decisions**. Starts in **Shadow** mode (always opens, records what Enforce would do)."
